# PKA weapons
ent-WeaponProtoKineticPistol = proto-kinetic pistol
    .desc = The pistol trades base damage and range for double mod capacity, making it a truly customizable PKA.
ent-WeaponProtoKineticRepeater = proto-kinetic repeater
    .desc = The repeater trades mod space and a bit of damage for the ability to fire three shots in rapid succession before needing to recharge.
ent-WeaponProtoKineticRailgun = proto-kinetic railgun
    .desc = The railgun trades customization, fire rate, and storage capabilities for the ability to fire a high damage shot that penetrates creatures.
ent-WeaponProtoKineticShotgun = proto-kinetic shotgun
    .desc = The shotgun fires a short range set of three rounds that does more damage than base PKA if all three shots land.

# Kinetic melee weapons
ent-WeaponKineticSpear = kinetic spear
    .desc = A long-ranged melee weapon which trades damage for a two-tile reach, similar to reagent/bone spears.
ent-WeaponKineticHammer = kinetic hammer
    .desc = A beefy, two-handed weapon that inflicts knockback and heavier damage than a crusher, but cannot backstab.
ent-WeaponKineticClaws = kinetic claws
    .desc = Unleash your inner edgelord with this two-handed claw small enough to fit in your backpack. Deals a paltry 45 damage on mark detonation, but sports a massive backstab bonus.
ent-WeaponKineticMachete = kinetic machete
    .desc = A smaller, one-handed variant of the crusher. Deals about 40 less damage than the PKC, but has a 15% melee block chance.

# Bags and gear
ent-AdvancedOreBag = advanced ore bag
    .desc = A larger ore bag with a wider magnet pickup range.

# Machines
ent-MiningShop = MinerMagnet
    .desc = A dwarf's best friend!

# Meson vision action
ent-ActionToggleMesonVision = toggle meson vision
    .desc = See through walls and doors.

# Meson goggles (a separate item from the engineering goggles)
ent-ClothingEyesGlassesMesonScanner = optical meson scanner
    .desc = Green-tinted goggles using a proprietary polymer. While worn, they let you see through walls.

# Express delivery from the MinerMagnet
ent-MiningShopDeliveryBag = delivery bag
    .desc = A one-use bag with your ordered goods. Use it to spill the contents.

# Ore bags
ent-OreBag = ore bag
    .desc = A robust bag for salvage specialists and miners alike to carry large amounts of ore. Magnetises any nearby ores when attached to a belt.
ent-BorgOreBag = integrated ore bag
    .desc = A large ore bag built into the frame of a mining cyborg. Magnetises any nearby ores when held.
